A big insert then a small insert (>50 apart, one command) flushes a pending grow (169).
The undo log is built in increasing-position order; LIFO redo replays the high
(big) insert first, leaving grown pending when the low (small) insert runs.

-- input --
a
pppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
b
-- proto --
Hversion 2
Hnewname tag=0
Hmovname tag=0 "input"
Tversion 2
Tstartcmdfile
Hnewname tag=1
Hbindname tag=1
Hcurrent tag=1
Hmovname tag=1 "~~sam~~"
Hcheck0 tag=1
Hack
Tack
Hunlock
Tstartfile 0
Hbindname tag=0
Hcurrent tag=0
Hgrow tag=0 p=0 n=65
Hcheck0 tag=0
Hcheck0 tag=0
Hack
Trequest 0 0 65
Hdata tag=0 p=0 "a\npppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp\nb\n"
Tack
Hgrow tag=1 p=0 n=10
Hcheck0 tag=1
Hack
Trequest 1 0 10
Hdata tag=1 p=0 " +. input\n"
Tack
Hsetdot tag=1 p=10 n=10
Hunlock
cmd {\n1a/Z/\n2a/WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW/\n}\n
Hdirty tag=0
Hgrow tag=0 p=63 n=60
Hgrowdata tag=0 p=2 n=1 "Z"
Hcheck0 tag=0
Hack
Trequest 0 63 60
Hdata tag=0 p=64 "WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW"
Tack
Hsetdot tag=0 p=64 n=124
Hunlock
Texit
